  "body": "Embrace the ultimate coastal lifestyle with this exquisite 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom home at Okura Bay Views. Set on a generous 567 sqm lot with 258 sqm of living space, this home offers stunning ocean and rural views to the north and south.\r\n\r\nThis David Reid Homes design build will be completed on some of the last remaining land in Long Bay. Don’t miss the opportunity to enjoy long summer days on top of the world. \r\n\r\nThe cleverly thought-out home has been designed to make the most of the surrounding area and will be completed to the highest standards.  \r\n\r\nYou will have peace of mind knowing your home has been designed and built by David Reid Homes who have a long-standing reputation for designing and building high quality homes. \r\n\r\nWalking distance to: \r\n\r\nLong Bay Regional Park & Beach\r\n\r\nLong Bay College \r\n\r\nLong Bay Surf Club \r\n\r\nLong Bay Village and New World  \r\n\r\nA comprehensive structural and workmanship guarantee of up to 10 years is included.? \r\n\r\nCall Dean or Jamie now to find out more.",
